('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.6', 'Organization provides care in the intensive care and high dependency units, in a systematic manner.', 'COP.6.b', 'Commitment', 'The care is provided in intensive care and high dependency units based on written guidance by adequately available staff and equipment.'),
('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.6', 'Organization provides care in the intensive care and high dependency units, in a systematic manner.', 'COP.6.c', 'Commitment', 'Infection control practices are documented and followed. *.'),
('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.6', 'Organization provides care in the intensive care and high dependency units, in a systematic manner.', 'COP.6.d', 'Achievement', 'The organization shall implement a quality-assurance programme.'),
('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.6', 'Organization provides care in the intensive care and high dependency units, in a systematic manner.', 'COP.6.e', 'Commitment', 'The organisation has a mechanism to counsel the patient and / or family periodically.'),
('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.6', 'Organization provides care in the intensive care and high dependency units, in a systematic manner.', 'COP.6.f', 'Commitment', 'End of life care is provided in a consistent manner in the organization, and is in consonance with legal requirements.'),
('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.7', 'Organization provides safe obstetric care.', 'COP.7.a', 'Commitment', 'Obstetric services are organised and provided safely'),
