('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.11', 'Clinical procedures, as well as procedures in the operation theatre are performed in a safe and consistent manner.', 'COP.11.e', 'Commitment', 'The procedure is done adhering to standard precautions.'),
('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.11', 'Clinical procedures, as well as procedures in the operation theatre are performed in a safe and consistent manner.', 'COP.11.f', 'Commitment', 'Procedures / operation notes, post procedure monitoring and post-operative care plan are documented accurately in the patient record.'),
('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.11', 'Clinical procedures, as well as procedures in the operation theatre are performed in a safe and consistent manner.', 'COP.11.g', 'Commitment', 'Appropriate facilities, equipment, instruments and supplies are available in the operating theatre.'),
('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.11', 'Clinical procedures, as well as procedures in the operation theatre are performed in a safe and consistent manner.', 'COP.11.h', 'Achievement', 'The organization shall implement a quality assurance programme.'),
