('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.12', 'The organization identifies and manages patients who are at higher risk of morbidity and mortality.', 'COP.12.a', 'Commitment', 'The organization identifies and manages vulnerable patients.'),
('COP', 'Care of Patients', 'COP.12', 'The organization identifies and manages patients who are at higher risk of morbidity and mortality.', 'COP.12.b', 'Commitment', 'The organization provides for a safe and secure environment for the vulnerable patient.'),
